ROHINI_PANDE 
full data with all columns - rohini.csv

Source: The dataset full_applucation_envi_outcomes.dta is sourced from environmental clearnace applications compiled under the Rohini Pande research project on environmental governance and mining in India. 
The accompanying code reads the Stata fle, extracts key fields as state, district, tehsil, village, proposal name, company details, sector type, and geographic coordinates(latitude, longitude), and saves them in a clean CSV format.

Description: Contains geocoded locations of mining projects with administrative and company details.

Key Variables:
state, district, tehsil, village, latitude, longitude, sector_moefcc, proposal, company_name

Units:
Coordinates in decimal degrees (WGS84, EPSG:4326)

Files:
rohini_pande - input - full_application_envi_outcomes.dta    codes - rohini_pande.py geojson_rohini.py    output - rohini_mine_selected_data.csv  rohini_pandemines_india.geojson

link - https://dataverse.harvard.edu/dataset.xhtml?persistentId=doi:10.7910/DVN/NF5GZY